{"DOOR_LEAVE_REPLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|fact=rude",{"Wow, okay, no need to be like that, I only asked a question, jeez","Charming, real charming, I hope the dead find you before I do","Screw you too, {g:buddy|lady}, I'm leaving anyway","Well, that was nice, thanks a lot, remind me to be kind to you next time","I'm going, I'm going, no need to bite my head off","Well, that's the last time I knock on this door","Wow, I only asked, no need for language","Fine, fine, I'm leaving, I hope you choke on your own pride","Charming, just charming","Ouch, okay, message received"}},
