{"DOOR_SEARCH_REFUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|fact=visit_search_refused",{"No, no, I won't be searched, I'm a decent person, I don't deserve that","I'm not letting you touch my things, forget it, I'll go","Absolutely not, that's an insult, I came to ask for help, not to be treated like a criminal","You want to search me? No way, I'm leaving","Not a chance, my bag, my business, goodbye","Absolutely not, I'm not being frisked on a stranger's doorstep","No way, I came for help, not for humiliation","You can forget it, I'll leave before I let you touch my bag","Nope, nope, nope, search me and I scream"}},
