{"DOOR_SEARCH_REFUSE","fact=visit_search_refused",{"No, I'm not giving you permission to search me","We can talk from here, no search","I'm not letting you go through my things","I'd rather leave than have you rummage through my gear","That wasn't permission, leave my things alone"}},
