{"DOOR_THANKS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|fact=gave_food",{"Oh, you have no idea what this means to us","Thank you, thank you, I'll remember this, I'll remember your kindness always","Oh my... I can't believe it, thank you, truly, thank you","You're an angel, you really are, I won't forget this","Thank you, friend, I'll make it up to you, I will, somehow","I'm crying, sorry, I'm crying, it's just... nobody's been kind in so long","Thank you... I haven't eaten this good in a week!","You saved me, I mean it, I'll remember your face and your kindness","I'm crying, sorry, it's just... a stranger, giving me something, in these times","I'll pay you back, someday, somehow, I will","Thank you, truly, you've no idea what this means","Lord love you and your house"}},
{"DOOR_THANKS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|fact=fair_trade",{"Pleasure doing business with you, honest folks are rare these days","Good deal... come find me if you need anything else","Thanks, friend, you're one of the good ones","That's the way to do it, no tricks, no games, thank you","Nice doing business with you","Pleasure, pleasure, you're an honest sort, rare these days","Thanks, friend, if you need anything else, I'm along this road","Nice doing business, come find me again","That's the way trading should be, thank you","You drive a fair bargain, I like that"}},
