{"DOOR_WHO_REPLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|fact=beggar",{"It's just me, I'm sorry to bother you, I haven't eaten in two days, anything at all, a cracker","Please, I'm not here to cause trouble, I'm just hungry, so hungry, can you spare anything?","Hello? Hello, {sir}, I won't come in, I only need something to eat, anything","I'm sorry, I know it's a terrible time, I just... I'm starving, I'm so sorry to ask","Just a hungry person, that's all, please, even a spoonful of something","My name doesn't matter, I only want food, a little food, God bless you if you can","Hi, hi, I'm sorry, I know everyone's scared of knocks now, I'm not dangerous, I'm just hungry","Please open up, or just talk through the door, I don't mind, I only need something to eat","Please... please, I'm so hungry, I'd take anything, a crust, a spoon of anything","I'm not here to hurt you, I just can't remember my last meal, it was days ago","My kids are with me, they're by the road, they haven't eaten in two days, please","You don't have to open up, just slide something under, anything","I know how this looks, I know, I'm sorry, I'm so ashamed","I'd work for it, anything, chop wood, carry water, just something to eat","God bless you if you can spare a can, God bless you if you can't, too","I won't come in, I mean it, I'll stay right here on the step","Anything, a biscuit, a cracker, I'm not picky, I'm just empty"}},
{"DOOR_WHO_REPLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|fact=trader",{"Hey there, I'm a trader, I've got goods, tools, batteries, want to see what I've got?","Just a fellow with a bag full of stuff and a lot of miles on my boots, interested in a swap?","Name's not important, but my prices are fair, mostly, you looking to trade?","I've got what you need, or I can find it, for a price, you in the market?","Evening, folks, trader here, got some things you might want, no rush","Don't worry, I'm harmless, just trying to make a living, such as it is","Anyone home? I swap goods, fair deals, open the door a crack if you like","I've got batteries, needles, thread, aspirin, a few cans, what are you short on?","Fair prices, no cheating, no stealing, ask anyone along the road","I travel light, I trade smart, you tell me what you need","Got a lighter, got a razor, got a sewing kit, you in the market?","I've been walking since Tuesday with this pack, so I'll give you a good deal","Come on, let me show you what I've got, it can't hurt to look","Thief? I'm a merchant... there's a difference, mostly"}},
{"DOOR_WHO_REPLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|hour=21,4|fact=trader",{"It's late, I know, but I saw your light, got a few things to swap, if you're interested"}},
{"DOOR_WHO_REPLY","reg=law,swat|fact=law_census",{"Sheriff's office, {sir}, we're taking a head count, nothing to worry about, just talk to me","Deputy here, I need to know how many people are staying in this house, that's all","Census, folks, it's quick, who lives here and is anyone sick?","County, we're going door to door, just checking on everybody, you alright in there?","Evening, I'm with the county, I just need to ask a couple of questions, won't take long","Sheriff's department, we're doing a quick headcount, how many live here?","We're checking on everyone, folks, anybody sick? Anybody missing?","Just a census, nothing to worry about, how many are inside?","County is trying to account for everyone, I need names and numbers","Evening, folks, hold the door a crack, I only need a minute","We're also asking about bites, anyone in there bitten?"}},
