{"DOOR_WHO_REPLY","reg=military,elite|fact=law_census",{"Army, counting residents, state how many persons are present","Military patrol, answer a few questions, please, headcount and any wounded","Army, counting residents, how many people are inside?","Military patrol, report any wounded, any ill, any missing"}},
