{"DOOR_WHO_REPLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"It's just me, a neighbor, kind of, I live a few blocks over, can we talk?","Hello? Hello, is anyone alive in there? I'm not dangerous, I'm just... alone","I'm lost and I don't know where else to go, can you spare a minute?","Hi, hi, sorry, I'm only passing through, I saw your place, thought I'd ask","Hello? Anyone home? I'm not armed, honest","It's just me, only me, I just wanted to talk to somebody","Hello? Is anybody home? I can hear you in there, I'm not dangerous","Please, can I just say a few words through the door? I won't try anything","I saw your place from the road and I got curious, nothing more","I'm a neighbor, kind of, I live a ways down, I just wanted to say hi","Is it safe to be out here? Is it safe in there? Can you tell me?","Don't open, don't open, just tell me you're alive, that's all I need","Hi, hi, I'm sorry, I know it's rude, I'm just so lonely","I'm Tom, I'm just looking for somebody to talk to, five minutes, that's it"}},
